  "contribution_statements": [
    "Developed CTAG-FX from initial concept through system design and implementation.",
    "Extended CTAG into A&R-CTAG through LLM-based prompt refinement and retrieval-enhanced initialization.",
    "Designed and implemented the role-based synthesizer-to-FX mapping and integrated tone-shaping processor.",
    "Conducted signal-level analyses and scrambled-mapping ablation experiments.",
    "Developed the interactive demo website and demonstrated the resulting audio effects through guitar performances and NAM-based implementations."
  ],
